# Production Invariants

## Core features (never remove or weaken)

- Stopwatch RAF loop, start/pause carry, lap capture, and session persist in StopwatchScreen.
- Preset engine (buildRecommendedSessionPreset): health, telemetry, logs, and onboarding inputs must all remain wired. Do not remove any input branch.
- BreathWork guided cadence from breathPreset and manual inhale/hold/exhale mode.
- Onboarding profile collection and local persistence.

## Visual system (preserve or media-query gate)

- app-backdrop and app-frost pulse animations must remain enabled by default.
- Glass surfaces, gradients, timer-ring spin, breath-orb transitions stay as-is.
- To disable any animation for performance or accessibility: use @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) or @media (prefers-reduced-transparency: reduce). Never remove the default-on animation.
- Haptics fire only on native platforms and respect prefers-reduced-motion.

## Gate before merge

- Run `npm run verify:production` (lint + test + build) before any merge claim.
- After web source changes: `npm run cap:sync`.
- For iOS claims: Xcode archive or simulator build evidence.
- Do not commit service_role keys or .env files with secrets.
